{"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"t":"1718867188","x":0.7716049391467531,"w":0.069958845774332645,"y":0.046511627815394085},{"x":0.11522634243277741,"w":0.21604937235514321,"h":0.01453659587810685,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.053779069623368314,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.097383720819280373,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.11934155750476114,"c":1,"w":0.29012346903483077},{"y":0.1292697288759006,"c":1,"x":0.16255142995097249,"t":"This response clearly presents the data from the bar graph. The candidate presents","w":0.73456792195638021,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"t":"all the data for 1968 first and then the data for 2018. There is an overview in the","h":0.017835977080292387,"y":0.14481930546130128,"x":0.1604273588476311,"c":1,"w":0.70383280436197926},{"t":"final sentence, but it should summarise the main changes from the bar chart","c":1,"y":0.16279069751423325,"h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.15843622108044153,"w":0.6748971048990885},{"c":1,"y":0.17873969376163834,"w":0.71810699462890626,"t":"rather than just saying that expenditure 'had ... changed'. Information is arranged","x":0.15843621460726715,"h":0.016027748233718775},{"t":"coherently into four paragraphs, and there is clear overall progression. A range","c":1,"y":0.196113074476577,"x":0.16255143646137307,"w":0.69135803222656245,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"t":"of cohesive devices is used [Turning to 2018 | followed by | whereas] with an","c":1,"h":0.01454686781542891,"w":0.67489710489908861,"x":0.16049383427551051,"y":0.2136627905646995},{"x":0.16049383177203849,"y":0.22965116264319585,"w":0.63580245971679694,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"t":"awareness of referencing [former one | the othe categories | Last three]."},{"x":0.16049382045764105,"y":0.26295641951052318,"c":1,"h":0.01472320376914027,"w":0.70987655639648439,"t":"There are some less common examples of vocabulary [dropped dramatically to |"},{"w":0.68518519083658858,"c":1,"h":0.015988372